── (A) apptainer instance list — process-level view ──
$ apptainer instance list
  # → empty table if nothing is running
INSTANCE NAME    PID    IP    IMAGE

── (B) sac agents list — registry-level view ──
$ sac agents list
  # → all agents whose spec.yaml is under ~/.scitex/agent-container/agents/
(sac not installed or no agents registered)

── (C) JSON forms (machine-readable, for orchestrators) ──
$ apptainer instance list --json | jq ".instances[].instance"
$ sac agents list --json
